# NEVER commit these. This repository is public on GitHub.
#
# data/*.xlsx are the source exports and contain personal data belonging to
# other people: household names, street addresses, phone numbers, email
# addresses and vehicle license plates (the parking form), plus homeowner names
# and out-of-state owner addresses (the rental roll). Publishing that is not
# ours to do, and a push cannot be taken back -- it stays in the history, in any
# fork, and in GitHub's caches.
data/

# geocode_cache.json is a list of ~101 real resident addresses. Derived from the
# same data, same reasoning.
cache/

# Generated maps. Rebuilt by build.py, and they embed resident names in their
# labels, so they are both redundant and unsafe to publish.
output/
